{"unit_id":"tag:0DBI:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若<MATH_0002>是同构（isomorphism），则<MATH_0003>是 ph 覆盖（covering），它覆盖<MATH_0004>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0005>是 ph 覆盖（covering），且对每个<MATH_0006>有 ph 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007>，则<MATH_0008>是 ph 覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0009>是 ph 覆盖（covering），且<MATH_0010>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism），则<MATH_0011>是 ph 覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":["ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DBI:proof","translation":"断言 (1) 是清楚的。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n(3) 的证明。基变换（base change）<MATH_0001>局部有限型（locally of finite type），这是《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>的结论。因此，只需核对仿射开集（affine opens）上的条件。设<MATH_0002>是仿射开（affine open）子概形。由于<MATH_0003>拟紧（quasi-compact），可找到有限（finite）仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0004>，使得<MATH_0005>映入（maps）仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0006>。选择标准 ph 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007>，加细（refining）<MATH_0008>。由引理<REF_0002>，基变换（base change）<MATH_0009>是标准 ph 覆盖（covering）。注意，<MATH_0010>也是标准 ph 覆盖（covering）。由引理<REF_0003>，族（family）<MATH_0011>可由标准 ph 覆盖（covering）加细。由于<MATH_0012>加细（refines）<MATH_0013>，得到结论。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n(2) 的证明。复合（Composition）保持局部有限型（locally of finite type）这一性质，见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0004>。因此，只需核对仿射开集（affine opens）上的条件。设<MATH_0014>是仿射开集（affine open）。先选择标准 ph 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0015>，加细（refining）<MATH_0016>。设这个加细（refinement）由态射（morphisms）<MATH_0017>（在<MATH_0018>上）给出。则<MATH_0019>是 ph 覆盖（covering），这是 (3) 的结论。由于<MATH_0020>仿射（affine），可找到标准 ph 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0021>，加细这个族（family）。再应用引理<REF_0005>，可知<MATH_0022>可以由标准 ph 覆盖（covering）加细。由于<MATH_0023>加细（refines）<MATH_0024>，证明完毕。\n","allowed_english":["ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine opens","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映入"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refining","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"family","target_ter