{"unit_id":"tag:0DBC:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n关于大景（sites）的定义的动机和解释，见定义<REF_0001>之后的注记。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n在继续引入概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>的大 ph 景（site）之前，我们指出，大 ph 景（site）<MATH_0002>上的拓扑（topology）在某种意义上由所有概形（schemes）的范畴（category）上的 ph 拓扑（topology）诱导。\n\n","allowed_english":["ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DBK:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是定义<REF_0001>中的大 ph 景（site）。设<MATH_0002>。设<MATH_0003>是任意 ph 覆盖（covering），它覆盖<MATH_0004>。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 存在覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>，它是<MATH_0006>在景（site）<MATH_0007>中的覆盖，且加细（refines）<MATH_0008>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0009>是标准 ph 覆盖（covering），则它重言地（tautologically）等价（equivalent）于<MATH_0010>的一个覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0011>是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering），则它重言地（tautologically）等价（equivalent）于<MATH_0012>的一个覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":["ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"tautologically","target_term":"重言地"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"tautologically","target_term":"重言地"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"tautologically","target_term":"重言地","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DBK:proof","translation":"对每个<MATH_0001>，选择仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0002>，使得每个<MATH_0003>映入（maps）<MATH_0004>的某个仿射开（affine open）子概形。由引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>，加细（refinement）<MATH_0005>也是 ph 覆盖（covering），它覆盖<MATH_0006>。因此，可以假设每个<MATH_0007>都是仿射的（affine），且映入（maps）仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0008>，它属于<MATH_0009>。应用《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0003>，可知<MATH_0010>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0011>的一个对象（object）。随后，<MATH_0012>作为有限型（finite type）概形（scheme），它在<MATH_0013>上，同构（isomorphic）于对象（object）<MATH_0014>，它属于<MATH_0015>，这是再次应用《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0004>的结果。覆盖（covering）<MATH_0016>加细（refines）<MATH_0017>（因为它们同构（isomorphic））。此外，<MATH_0018>组合等价（combinatorially equivalent）于覆盖（covering）<MATH_0019>，它是<MATH_0020>在景（site）<MATH_0021>中的覆盖，这由《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0005>得出。覆盖（covering）<MATH_0022>是 (1) 中所述的加细（refinement）。在 (2)、(3) 的情形中，每个概形（schemes）<MATH_0023>都同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0024>中的一个对象（object），这由《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0006>得出；再应用《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0007>便得到所需结论。\n","allowed_english":["ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映入"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映入"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"combinatorially equivalent","target_term":"组合等价"},{"source_term":"covering",