{"unit_id":"tag:0DBL:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是包含<MATH_0003>的大 ph 景（big ph site）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001>大 ph 景（big ph site），它属于<MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，记为<MATH_0005>，是景（site）<MATH_0006>，在《景（Sites）》第<REF_0001>节中引入。\n<STRUCT_0003> <TEXTITOPEN_0002>大仿射 ph 景（big affine ph site），它属于<MATH_0007><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，记为<MATH_0008>，是<MATH_0009>的满子范畴（full subcategory），其对象（objects）为仿射的（affine）<MATH_0010>。<MATH_0011>的覆盖（covering）是任意有限（finite）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0012>，它覆盖<MATH_0013>，满足<MATH_0014>，且<MATH_0015>仿射（affine）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"big ph site","target_term":"大 ph 景"},{"source_term":"big ph site","target_term":"大 ph 景"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"big affine ph site","target_term":"大仿射 ph 景"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"big ph site","target_term":"大 ph 景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"big affine ph site","target_term":"大仿射 ph 景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DBC:prose-0006","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，<MATH_0001>中的覆盖（coverings）<TEXTITOPEN_0001>不是<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>由标准 ph 覆盖（coverings）给出的。原因仅仅是，这样会违反《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>的第二条公理。相反，<MATH_0002>中的覆盖（coverings）是那些有限（finite）族（families）<MATH_0003>，由有限型（finite type）态射（morphisms）组成，态射位于仿射（affine）对象（objects）之间，这些对象属于<MATH_0004>，且这些族可由标准 ph 覆盖（covering）加细。我们明确陈述并证明大仿射（affine）ph 景（site）是景（site）。\n\n","allowed_english":["ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"families","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"families","target_term":"族","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
