{"unit_id":"tag:0DBP:proof","translation":"特殊余连续（cocontinuous）函子（functor）的概念在《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>中引入。因此，须验证《景（Sites）》引理<REF_0002>的假设 (1)–(5)。记包含函子（inclusion functor）为<MATH_0001>。余连续（cocontinuous）由以下事实得出：任意 ph 覆盖（covering），它覆盖<MATH_0002>，其中<MATH_0003>仿射（affine），按定义都可由标准 ph 覆盖（covering）加细，该覆盖覆盖<MATH_0004>。因此 (1) 成立。<MATH_0005>连续（continuous），仅仅是因为仿射概形（affine）由仿射概形（affines）构成的有限（finite）ph 覆盖（covering）是 ph 覆盖（covering）。因此 (2) 成立。(3)、(4) 立即由<MATH_0006>全忠实（fully faithful）这一事实得出。最后，条件 (5) 由每个概形（scheme）都有仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）（这也是 ph 覆盖（covering））这一事实得出。\n","allowed_english":["ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cocontinuous","target_term":"余连续"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"inclusion functor","target_term":"包含函子"},{"source_term":"cocontinuous","target_term":"余连续"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cocontinuous","target_term":"余连续","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"inclusion functor","target_term":"包含函子","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续","context":"待