{"unit_id":"tag:0DBQ:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上的预层（presheaf）。则<MATH_0003>是层（sheaf）当且仅当：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004>对 Zariski 覆盖（coverings）满足层条件（sheaf condition），且\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0005>固有（proper）且满射（surjective），则<MATH_0006>双射地（bijectively）映到（maps）两个映射（maps）<MATH_0007>的等化子（equalizer）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n此外，在 (1) 成立时，性质 (2) 等价（equivalent）于性质：\n<STRUCT_0005>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>(2')<ITEMCLOSE_0001> 对 (2) 中的<MATH_0008>，其中<MATH_0009>仿射（affine），满足层性质（sheaf property）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"bijectively","target_term":"双射地"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映到"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"bijectively","target_term":"双射地","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映到","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质","context":"待决"}]